    "body": "> I'm not convinced that this changes anything.\n\nRight, that's why it's labeled \"editorial\" and a \"clarification\" :). No normative change is intended here, just clarifying the existing semantics in the spec. I think it's fine if your implementation of displaying multi-level headings is to just display the first level...\n",
